  (text "BMS 2-4S Li-ion + USB-C PD dua arah + output terminal 1-16V\nSemua part tersedia di Tokopedia (docs/bom_tokopedia.md)\n\nAlur daya:\n  USB-C -> TPS65988 (PD, switch 20V/5A) -> VBUS_SYS -> BQ25713 (buck-boost) -> VSYS\n  VSYS -> BATFET -> PACK+ -> FET proteksi P-ch -> sekring -> cell 2-4S\n  VBUS_SYS -> XL4005 -> terminal 1-16V (saat baterai: OTG BQ25713 mengisi VBUS_SYS)\n  BATT+/VSYS -> BAT54C -> HT7533 -> +3V3 (STM32G031, TPS65988)\n\nRail global (simbol power): VBUS_SYS, VSYS, PACK+, BATT+, +3V3, GND\nSinyal antar sheet: wire di diagram ini (sheet pin = hierarchical label)\n\nStatus: DRAFT v0.2 - lihat README.md bagian VERIFIKASI sebelum layout PCB." (at 30.48 195.58 0)
